                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10"># Heading level 1
## :span[Heading level 2]{color="lightgreen"}
### Heading level 3

:span[This shows]{color="blue"} **:span[bold text]{color="#ff00ff"}** mixed with *:span[italic]{color="gray"}* and normal text.

Italicized text is the *cat's meow*.

*:span[This is italic text.]{color="green"}*

The text widget uses  [github-flavored markdown](https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/writing-on-github/getting-started-with-writing-and-formatting-on-github/basic-writing-and-formatting-syntax), with a an extension for colored text.

* :span[Bullet in an unordered list]{color="blue"}.
* Bullet in an unordered list.</item>
